      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503703000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503712600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return some shoes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 13636,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503717200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To get started, could I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503719266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Doe. Order is 78-21-Charlie.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 13636,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503726399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. I'm pulling that up now... I see the order here for the VeloFit cycling shoes. Is it a technical fault with the item or more of a personal preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503728799999
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. So I'd say they don't work.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 13636,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503740533332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Comfort is key for a good ride. Let me just check the purchase date to review the return options for you. One moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503744066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 13636,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503753999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for your patience. I see the order was delivered 77 days ago. Looking at our policy, you are well within the 90-day window for a return.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503754699998
    },
    {
      "text": "Right. So I can return them?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 13636,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766503765033331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I can process that for you right now. I will email you a prepaid shipping label. Just place the shoes and the cleats back in the box, attach the label, and you can drop it off. Once our warehouse receives it, we will issue a full refund to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
